{
  "id": "PRO.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Egetabu ki’Emebeyano 6",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokuurerwa konde",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, ande kweruure koba intenenera ase omonto omino, na kwarire eira ase omonto omoao na kobwatana nere amaboko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana gwakwanete korwa ase omonwa oo akobwatire buna omotego.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio omwana one, bono nigo ore inse y’okobua kw’omonto oyio, na onye korigetie gwetooria korwa ase are okore iga: Kabe omoitongo, ogende ase are omosorore, erinde agosibore korwa ase eira eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa korara gose gosundoka;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "minyoka buna engabi egotama erue ase omotwari, na buna enyoni egotama erue ase omotegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ore omworo, geenda ase amage, origererie orore buna agokora emeremo n’omokia onyore obong’aini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aro tabwati omogambi, gose omoteneneri, gose omoraai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende nigo agosangereria chindagera chiabo chingaki chi’egura gura, achigacha goika ekero ki’eguru‐gura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omworo, ’ngoika ririri oragenderere korara? Ndiriri orabooke korwa ase chitoro chiao?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoraara ake, okwegondia ake; okoringania amaboko gotimoka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obotaka ’mbogoochere buna omouri agoocha, na oboremerwa booche buna omonto obwate ebirwanero agocha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto otagwenereti kende ore omokori amabe nigo agoeta‐eta, ogokwana oborimo korwa ase omonwa oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo agosumera ebioge bi’amaiso aye, naende nigo agosumera amagoro, na okworokia ebimanyererio n’amaboko aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogoitania abanto nigo goichire ase enkoro yaye, botambe nigo akoroberia korenta amabe; nigo agosimeka chimbusuro chi’ogotaigwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio emechando nemoochere mobosokano; nigo arasirigwe mobasokano atanyaare gotoorigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbire ebinto bitano nakemo Omonene ageechete, ee, mbire bitan’abibere bire okogeecha ase are, nabio ebi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okorigereria kw’oboenenu, na oromeme rogokwana oborimo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "amaboko agoitera amanyinga atari na komocha;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enkoro ekoroberia amabe, na amagoro akominyoka gochia gokora amabe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kirori bw’oborimo, ogokwana oborimo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na omonto ogosimeka chimbusuro chi’ogoitania ase egati y’abanto abamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokuurerwa gw’okwanga obonyaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, igwera aya inche iso ’nkogochika, na totiga amorokererio a nyoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasibe, ageenderere kobeera ase enkoro yao botambe, naende oyasibe ase rigoti ria’o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero or’abe kogotaara, aro nakoraae; ekero or’abe koraire, ’nakorende, na ekero or’abe gokoboka, ayio nakwane naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amachiiko nigo are etaya, na amorokererio nigo are oborabu; ogokuurera gw’okorongeigwa nigo kore enchera y’obogima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo korakorende korwa ase omokungu omonyaka, na korwa ase amang’ana y’oromeme rw’aye oroterere rokoebereria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa komogania ase enkoro yao ime ase engencho y’ekieni kiaye ekiya; amaiso aye tabaisa gokong’usa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho y’omokuungu omotayayi omonto nigo akoremerwa oborwa nonya negesamunye ki’omogati, na omokungu bw’omonto omoao nigo akorigia obogima bw’omonto obosaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Omonto nabogorie omorero ayobeeke ase egekuba kiaye, ne chianga chiaye tichiyia?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose nataare ase rieera ri’omorero, na amagoro aye tayia?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo er’abe ase omonto ogotomana n’omokungu bw’omonto onde; onde bwensi okoba nomokuungu oyio goika aegwe egesusuro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto tibari gochaaya omoibi onye ore koiba endagera ekiagera are n’enchara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya naboigo omoibi oria kanyorirwe, goika airanie ara gatano na kabere; nigo araakane ebinto bionsi abwate nyomba mwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto ogotomana nomokuungu onde bwensi, oyio tabwati chiseemi; oyo ogokora ayio nigo agwesaria ere omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio nigo arabe n’amaakwa naende asirie amasikani onsi. Obosooku bwaye tibogotinyigwa boere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
